      "sourceTextSha256": "e9c323f189ecc2839c6a20965c9d699cbc5c5106330f68b1c839932d99def1f4",
      "text": "Transfer to Uyuni Airport and fly to La Paz. On arrival, meet your driver for the transfer to your hotel. In the afternoon, take a city sightseeing tour and visit Moon Valley.",
